<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"><title>No Smart Match | NETS Vouch AI</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
  <body><main class="prototype-stage"><section class="phone-shell">
    <div class="status-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span>9:41</span><span class="status-bar__island"></span><span class="status-bar__signals">● ◢ ▰</span></div>
    <header class="app-bar"><div class="wordmark"><span class="wordmark__nets">NETS</span><span class="wordmark__vouch">Vouch</span></div><span class="prototype-label">Prototype</span></header>
    <div class="phone-viewport"><div class="screen screen--recommendation">
      <header class="recommendation-heading"><a class="icon-button" href="/home">←</a><div><p class="eyebrow">Vouch AI Smart Match</p><h1>No suitable match right now</h1></div></header>
      <div class="no-match-card"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h2>Your preferences were respected</h2><p>No participating option currently fits <strong><%= dietaryPreferenceLabel %></strong>, a $<%= profile.budget.toFixed(2) %> budget and a <%= profile.maxDistanceMinutes %>-minute walking range.</p></div>
      <p class="verification-note">Smart Match avoids showing items that conflict with Jia's saved profile settings.</p>
      <div class="screen-actions screen-actions--bottom"><a class="button button--full" href="/profile?tab=settings">Edit Profile Settings</a><a class="back-home-link" href="/home">Back to Home</a></div>
    </div></div><div class="home-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </section></main><script src="/js/script.js"></script></body>
</html>
